ác chương trình đào tạo của TCT trong năm 2014.&amp;quot;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Mt.Long phân công nhân sự tổ thiết bị đầu cuối thực hiện công việc này.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Khánh kiểm tra các đầu mục phát sinh dùm anh.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;PS&amp;#58; Gửi anh Tâm theo dõi mảng phần mềm liên quan Cảng sử dụng để quản lý.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="line-height&amp;#58;19.200000762939453px;"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="line-height&amp;#58;19.200000762939453px;"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="line-height&amp;#58;19.200000762939453px;"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="line-height&amp;#58;19.200000762939453px;"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="line-height&amp;#58;19.200000762939453px;"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="line-height&amp;#58;19.200000762939453px;"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="line-height&amp;#58;19.200000762939453px;"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="line-height&amp;#58;19.200000762939453px;"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="line-height&amp;#58;19.200000762939453px;"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="line-height&amp;#58;19.200000762939453px;"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="line-height&amp;#58;19.200000762939453px;"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="line-height&amp;#58;19.200000762939453px;"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="line-height&amp;#58;19.200000762939453px;"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="line-height&amp;#58;19.200000762939453px;"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="line-height&amp;#58;19.200000762939453px;"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="line-height&amp;#58;19.200000762939453px;"&gt;&lt;br&gt