oài Nam - TCIS</d:Title></m:properties></content></entry></feed></m:inline></link><link rel="http://schemas.microsoft.com/ado/2007/08/dataservices/related/Author" type="application/atom+xml;type=entry" title="Author" href="Web/Lists(guid'fec511d8-e617-41c0-9c63-ead5cb201f8a')/Items(1407)/Author"><m:inline><entry><id>e213c89e-585f-4804-8454-ed7da79339a3</id><category term="SP.Data.UserInfoItem" scheme="http://schemas.microsoft.com/ado/2007/08/dataservices/scheme" /><title /><updated>2026-05-19T03: 36: 31Z</updated><author><name /></author><content type="application/xml"><m:properties><d:Title>Hoàng Văn Anh - GĐTT TCIS</d:Title></m:properties></content></entry></m:inline></link><link rel="http://schemas.microsoft.com/ado/2007/08/dataservices/related/Editor" type="application/atom+xml;type=entry" title="Editor" href="Web/Lists(guid'fec511d8-e617-41c0-9c63-ead5cb201f8a')/Items(1407)/Editor"><m:inline><entry><id>6d2f69fa-805c-4b43-9f96-21930acef3ca</id><category term="SP.Data.UserInfoItem" scheme="http://schemas.microsoft.com/ado/2007/08/dataservices/scheme" /><title /><updated>2026-05-19T03: 36: 31Z</updated><author><name /></author><content type="application/xml"><m:properties><d:Title>Hoàng Văn Anh - GĐTT TCIS</d:Title></m:properties></content></entry></m:inline></link><title /><updated>2026-05-19T03: 36: 31Z</updated><author><name /></author><content type="application/xml"><m:properties><d:FileSystemObjectType m:type="Edm.Int32">0</d:FileSystemObjectType><d:Id m:type="Edm.Int32">1407</d:Id><d:ContentTypeId>0x010800D69788E4040B5E40B89CFE80B4DD7962</d:ContentTypeId><d:Title>Khảo sát máy in Đội Cơ giới 4/XNCG</d:Title><d:Priority>Thường</d:Priority><d:PercentComplete m:type="Edm.Double">1</d:PercentComplete><d:AssignedToId m:type="Collection(Edm.Int32)"><d:element>965</d:element></d:AssignedToId><d:Body>&lt;div class="ExternalClass1EFC1605E77F438BABFD3B5316F71471"&gt;&lt;p&gt;Long cho nhân sự khảo sát máy in trong ngày hôm nay.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;--------------------------​&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="line-height&amp;#58;19.200000762939453px;"&gt;Căn cứ&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="line-height&amp;#58;19.200000762939453px;"&gt;công văn đề nghị&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="line-height&amp;#58;19.200000762939453px;"&gt;ngày&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="line-height&amp;#58;19.200000762939453px;"&gt;​12/5/2014 của XNCG (đính kèm), đề nghị TCIS tiến hành khảo sát máy in VP Đội CG4. Trong trường hợp máy không in được thì trang bị tạm thời 1 máy in cũ (trong số các máy vừa sửa đợt trước), đồng thời báo cáo kết quả khảo sát về P. CNTT.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="line-height&amp;#58;19.200000762939453px;"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</d:Body><d:StartDate m:type="Edm.DateTime">2014-05-14T01: 00: 00Z</d:StartDate><d:DueDate m:type="Edm.DateTime">2014-05-19T10: 00: 00Z</d:DueDate><d:BaoCaoNhiemVu m:null="true" /><d:DanhGiaCongViec m:type="Edm.Boolean">true</d:DanhGiaCongViec><d:DateCompleted m:type="Edm.DateTime">2014-05-19T07: 35: 49Z</d:DateCompleted><d:DepartmentManagerId m:null="true" /><d:ItemParentID>1388</d:ItemParentID><d:NguoiPhoiHopId m:type="Collection(Edm.Int32)"><d:element>1301</d:element></d:NguoiPhoiHopId><d:PriorityEN>Normal</d:PriorityEN><d:Rating>10</d:Rating><d:SendMailWhenUpdate m:type="Edm.Boolean">true</d:SendMailWhenUpdate><d:StatusEN>Completed</d:StatusEN><d:TheoDoiCongViecId m:type="Collection(Edm.Int32)"><d:element>804</d:element><d:element>450</d:element><d:element>740</d:element><d:element>454</d:element><d:element>455</d:element><d:element>591</d:element><d:element>427</d:element><d:element>965</d:element><d:element>1301</d:element></d:TheoDoiCongViecId><d:TinhTrangGiaoViec>Đồng ý</d:TinhTrangGiaoViec><d:TinhTrangGiaoViecEN>Approved</d:TinhTrangGiaoViecEN><d:XacNhan m:type="Edm.Boolean">false</d:XacNhan><d:NguoiTheoDoiId m:type="Edm.Int32">804</d:NguoiTheoDoiId><d:ManagerId m:null="true" /><d:nStatus>Hoàn thành</d:nStatus><d:ID m:type="Edm.Int